{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05757","headline":"家叔徵君东溪草堂二首 一 · 卢象","name":"家叔徵君东溪草堂二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开山十余里，青壁森相倚。\n欲识尧时天，东溪白云是。\n雷声转幽壑，云气杳流水。\n涧影生龙蛇，岩端翳柽梓。\n大道终不易，君恩曷能已。\n鹤羡无老时，龟言摄生理。\n浮年笑六甲，元化潜一指。\n未暇扫云梯，空慙阮氏子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}